<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<mei xmlns="http://www.music-encoding.org/ns/mei" meiversion="5.1" xml:id="hum">
  <meiHead>
    <fileDesc>
      <titleStmt>
        <title>Träumerei (Schumann), as Grünfeld might hum it while playing: a bass reduction</title>
      </titleStmt>
      <pubStmt>
        <p>A draft reduction for an amateur bass hummer (about an octave). Every sung note points (@corresp) to the note of transcription.mei it comes from; rests are breaths; notes with x heads are a voiceless stream of air (@type: air-teeth, air-lips); @type="pedal" marks a note held on while the piano moves.</p>
      </pubStmt>
      <sourceDesc>
        <source target="transcription.mei"/>
      </sourceDesc>
    </fileDesc>
  </meiHead>
